    "post_rendered": "Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14d5aa37a2f00caf9a499f03020c9a776036290d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"\\( f : \\mathbb{R}^+ \\to \\mathbb{R}^+ \\)\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" > such that for all positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c78a72753c42785bc9a158446273e7bbb8f0643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"\\( x \\)\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > and <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/4/87402619961b7af273a2f9f2b255badcb94300a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"\\( y \\)\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" >,</span> we have<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de05eacbdf3560fdd0026b5e15cd6e8b956e17e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\nf(f(f(xy)) + x^2) = f(y)(f(x) - f(x + y)).\n\\]\"  width=\"335\" height=\"20\" ><br>\nProposed by <i>Sobhan Aram</i>",
